/// `CRATONVM_FFM_DOWNCALL_PERMISSIVE_SETTLED` (default ON, `=0` off; JIT round
/// 16 wave 13, lane ffmseg): the memo paths' access verdict
/// ([`downcall_access_settled`]) also holds under a `Permissive` capability
/// policy, not only with no policy in the process.
